<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet, no sales-USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet, no sales-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet near midday Monday, with no sales slaughter steers or heifers confirmed, according to USDA. Inquiry good, demand moderate.</p>
<p>Sales confirmed for the week to date including late Friday and the weekend on 400 head. Sales FOB feedlot net weights after 4 percent shrink.</p>
<p>Confirmed - none</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
